mixin contactBtn(props = {})
  -
    var {
      classNames = "",
      hasIcon = true,
    } = props;

  button.btn.btn--secondary(
    class=`${hasIcon ? "btn--with-icon " : ""}${classNames}`
    type="button"
    data-show-contact-info
  )
    | Skontaktuj się z nami

    if hasIcon
      span.icon
        svg
          use(href="/__spritemap#phone")
